          (text "SELV strip: mezzanine, conditioning, relay and fan interface" (at 297.18 10.16 0)
          (effects (font (size 3.5 3.5) (bold yes)) (justify top))
          (uuid "0f3a4c7e-2626-5e8d-a13a-d110279044c3"))
(text "Mezzanine socket SSW-125-01-G-D with the pin assignment of design_decisions.json; receiving networks 100 ohm / 100 pF / 10 k pull-down on RESET_N and BIAS_EN (A-P6);\nOPA2320 difference amplifiers gain 1.5; REF3125 -> VOC_SET 0.750 V (I_OC 37.5 A); ISENSE_REF = 0.1 x 3V3 (A-P1); AO3400A + SS14 relay coil drive; fan header with tacho\npull-up. All nets on this sheet are SELV (CTRL_SELV). PWR_FLAG symbols state supply provenance for ERC; they do not prove voltage, current capacity or protection." (at 6.35 15.24 0)
